"　　汝南文成王亮，字子翼，宣帝第四子也。少清警有才用，仕魏為散騎侍郎、萬歲亭侯，拜東中郎將，進封廣陽鄉侯。討諸葛誕于壽春，失利，免官。頃之，拜左將軍，加散騎常侍、假節，出監豫州諸軍事。五等建，改封祁陽伯，轉鎮西將軍。武帝踐阼，封扶風郡王，邑萬戶，置騎司馬，增參軍掾屬，持節、都督關中雍、涼諸軍事。會秦州刺史胡烈為羌虜所害，亮遣將軍劉旂、騎督敬琰赴救，不進，坐是貶為平西將軍。旂當斬，亮與軍司曹冏上言，節度之咎由亮而出，乞丐旂死。詔曰：「高平困急，計城中及旂足以相拔，就不能徑至，尚當深進。今奔突有投，而坐視覆敗，故加旂大戮。今若罪不在旂，當有所在。」有司又奏免亮官，削爵土。詔惟免官。頃之，拜撫軍將軍。是歲，吳將步闡來降，假亮節都督諸軍事以納之。尋加侍中之服。","source_position":{"first_line":18,"last_line":18,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true,"revision_id":2650517},"raw_quote_sha256":"89427a9917a05dd3b40e84d6049c15f08bd01f9b34a4b163ead6b8d7e5e9fb3a","text_sha256":"829934285020258d153bf9c633cac38c2e0e18f703e2eea68a27f7245a8070ab","mentions":[{"start":0,"end":6,"surface":"汝南文成王亮","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAC","id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line018:m0000"},{"start":8,"end":10,"surface":"子翼","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAC","id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line018:m0008"},{"start":11,"end":13,"surface":"宣帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAA","id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line018:m0011"},{"start":52,"end":55,"surface":"諸葛誕","kind":"person","person_id":"655_392_7f8","id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line018:m0052"},{"start":106,"end":108,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle","id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line018:m0106"},{"start":151,"end":153,"surface":"胡烈","kind":"person","person_id":"e6b_238_635","id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line018:m0151"},{"start":154,"end":156,"surface":"羌虜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"resolution_note":"未辨具體成員的交戰群體。","status":"unresolved","id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line018:m0154"},{"start":159,"end":160,"surface":"亮","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAC","id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line018:m0159"},{"start":163,"end":165,"surface":"劉旂","kind":"person","person_id":"2f8_32d_8fc","id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line018:m0163"},{"start":168,"end":170,"surface":"敬琰","kind":"person","person_id":"394_a7c_4f6","id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line018:m0168"},{"start":185,"end":186,"surface":"旂","kind":"person","p